{"id":"b9a9d2bf0a32514c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-csp-instance.md","title":"有限字母表约束满足实例与值","display":"df-csp-instance — 有限字母表约束满足实例与值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-csp-instance","aliases":["28-df-csp-instance"],"display":"df-csp-instance — 有限字母表约束满足实例与值","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Definition 22.1","source_printed_pages":"461","source_pdf_pages":"487","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-csp-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-csp-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-csp-instance — 有限字母表约束满足实例与值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 22.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"461"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"487"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,W,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(q,W,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[h]=\\{1,\\ldots,h\\}\">\\([h]=\\{1,\\ldots,h\\}\\)</span>。实例候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(n,W,q,(\\vec i_r,P_r)_{r=1}^m)\">\\(\\Phi=(n,W,q,(\\vec i_r,P_r)_{r=1}^m)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec i_r\\in[n]^q\">\\(\\vec i_r\\in[n]^q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_r:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(P_r:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。允许索引重复和重复约束；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in[W]^n\">\\(a\\in[W]^n\\)</span> 是赋值。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 为无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；相邻字串表示连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 表示按下标递增连接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}},\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q},\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}},\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q},\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in[W]^q\">\\(u\\in[W]^q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(P:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，字串坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\coloneqq\\{(n,W,q,(\\vec i_r,P_r)_{r=1}^m):n,m\\ge1\\land\\forall r\\in[m]\\;(\\vec i_r\\in[n]^q\\land P_r:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\coloneqq\\{(n,W,q,(\\vec i_r,P_r)_{r=1}^m):n,m\\ge1\\land\\forall r\\in[m]\\;(\\vec i_r\\in[n]^q\\land P_r:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m(\\Phi)\\coloneqq m,\\qquad \\operatorname{sat}(\\Phi,a)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\sum_{r=1}^mP_r(a_{i_{r,1}},\\ldots,a_{i_{r,q}}),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in[W]^n}\\operatorname{sat}(\\Phi,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m(\\Phi)\\coloneqq m,\\qquad \\operatorname{sat}(\\Phi,a)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\sum_{r=1}^mP_r(a_{i_{r,1}},\\ldots,a_{i_{r,q}}),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in[W]^n}\\operatorname{sat}(\\Phi,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Satisfiable}(\\Phi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Satisfiable}(\\Phi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}(u)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{j=1}^q(u_j-1)W^{q-j},\\qquad\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}:[W]^q\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[W^q].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}(u)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{j=1}^q(u_j-1)W^{q-j},\\qquad\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}:[W]^q\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[W^q].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P)\\in\\Sigma^{W^q},\\qquad\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P)_{\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}(u)}\\coloneqq P(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P)\\in\\Sigma^{W^q},\\qquad\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P)_{\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}(u)}\\coloneqq P(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(W)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(q)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(m)\\mathop{\\frown}_{r=1}^m\\left[\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^q\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(i_{r,j})\\right)\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P_r)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(W)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(q)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(m)\\mathop{\\frown}_{r=1}^m\\left[\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^q\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(i_{r,j})\\right)\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P_r)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}:\\bigcup_{q,W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}:\\bigcup_{q,W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限非空赋值集保证最大值存在；m≥1 避免除以零。本项把前章二元字母表 qCSP 推广为本章任意有限字母表，同时明确重复约束按重数计值。约束以真值表表示，规模包括所有表项。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 22.1；印刷页 461；PDF 页 487。</p>\n<p>本次内容补全：显式编码保留每个约束的编号列、完整真值表及列表顺序，重复约束仍按重数计数。长度包括全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mW^q\">\\(mW^q\\)</span> 个表项；参数、索引和真值表字段边界由前缀码与头部确定，编码、解码及像判定可在相应显式表示长度的多项式时间内完成。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"q,W,n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"[h]=\\{1,\\ldots,h\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi=(n,W,q,(\\vec i_r,P_r)_{r=1}^m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec i_r\\in[n]^q","display":false},{"tex":"P_r:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in[W]^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}},\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q},\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in[W]^q","display":false},{"tex":"P:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\coloneqq\\{(n,W,q,(\\vec i_r,P_r)_{r=1}^m):n,m\\ge1\\land\\forall r\\in[m]\\;(\\vec i_r\\in[n]^q\\land P_r:[W]^q\\to\\{0,1\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"m(\\Phi)\\coloneqq m,\\qquad \\operatorname{sat}(\\Phi,a)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\sum_{r=1}^mP_r(a_{i_{r,1}},\\ldots,a_{i_{r,q}}),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in[W]^n}\\operatorname{sat}(\\Phi,a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Satisfiable}(\\Phi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\qquad(j\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}(u)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{j=1}^q(u_j-1)W^{q-j},\\qquad\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}:[W]^q\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[W^q].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P)\\in\\Sigma^{W^q},\\qquad\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P)_{\\operatorname{idx}_{W,q}(u)}\\coloneqq P(u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(n)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(W)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(q)\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(m)\\mathop{\\frown}_{r=1}^m\\left[\\left(\\mathop{\\frown}_{j=1}^q\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(i_{r,j})\\right)\\operatorname{tab}_{W,q}(P_r)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}:\\bigcup_{q,W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*.","display":true},{"tex":"mW^q","display":false}],"bytes":3146,"backlinks":[{"id":"218c13faf9022f13","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W},\\operatorname{val},m$ 见 [[28-df-csp-instance]]；$\\mathcal C=\\bigcup_{q,W\\ge1}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}$，$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}$ 采用该文件给出的具体编码；$\\langle\\Phi\\rangle$ 的含义由下式固定；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。"},{"id":"56e6e33833fc4900","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi=(n,W,2,((i_r,j_r),P_r)_{r=1}^m)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{2,W}$，见 [[28-df-csp-instance]]；每个约束保留独立边标号 r。$v\\in[n]$，$d\\in\\mathbb N$；自环有两个关联端点。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-396","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}